          <type>const <ref refid="classIMP_1_1domino_1_1Assignment" kindref="compound">Assignment</ref> &amp;</type>
          <declname>state</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Return a next possible acceptable state for the particle in pos. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The default implementation returns the current value +1. This method needs to make sure it does not skip any valid states.</para>
<para>The method can assume <computeroutput>!get_is_ok</computeroutput>(state) and that the state minus pos is ok. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
